/obj/item/elementalessence/casta
	name = "Casta essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Casta, channeling Astrata's domain of the right to rule, justice, order, and diplomacy. Looking at it makes you aware of your place in the grand scheme of things, even if momentarily, how you are little more than the role you play in your daily life and others."

/obj/item/elementalessence/dameion
	name = "Dame Ion essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Dame Ion, channeling Dendor's domain of harvest, and Noc's domain of magic, knoweledge, and tolerance. Merely holding it fills you with potential, and curiosity towards the wilderness, of all the natural and magical bounties it has to offer."

/obj/item/elementalessence/esmaryalia
	name = "Esma Ryalia essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Esma Ryalia, channeling Eora's domain of fertility, health, and family. It radiates the comforting warmth of a hearth, and a gentle caress of the spring sun on a dewy morning, reminding you of perhaps better, more careless days, and the ambition to bestow such joy upon others."

/obj/item/elementalessence/falahn
	name = "Falahn essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Falahn, channeling Dendor's domain of hunting and wild animals. It promises a comforting lyfe, where every action you take has meaning, a life away from the pursuit of currency and status, to become one with lyfe."

/obj/item/elementalessence/nerat
	name = "Ner At essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Ner At, channeling Ravox's domain of law, judgement, Necra's domain of death, and Pestra's domain of medicine. It reminds you how complicated the affair of life and death are, and how we ourselves are judges of who gets to live and die, whenever through honorable combat, power in law, or skill in medicine, everyone can be an arbitory of other's lyves."

/obj/item/elementalessence/adeanion
	name = "Adea Nion essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Adea Nion, channeling Ravox's domain of honor and duty. Holding it makes you feel weighted by a strong sense of burden that some must shoulder for society to exist, especially in these trying times..."

/obj/item/elementalessence/ryalia
	name = "Ryalia essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Ryalia, channeling Eora's domain of love, beauty, and romance. Holding it makes you feel in a special way, that only looking at someone who you want to spend the rest of your lyfe with would mimic."

/obj/item/elementalessence/balgar
	name = "Balgar essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Balgar, channeling Malum's domain of construction. It reminds you of your potential to leave your mark on the world, with nothing more than a hammer and a handful of materials, whenever it be a grand monument, or a comfy little home."

/obj/item/elementalessence/ara
	name = "Ara essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Ara, channeling Xylix's domain of luck, and Matthios' domain of fortune and exchanges. A constant reminder how fickle fate might be, and a chance to take opportunities to take destiny into your own hands."

/obj/item/elementalessence/munas
	name = "Munas essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Munas, channeling Xylix's domain of carelessness. It radiates with a whimsical desire to live lyfe from moment to moment, and embrace what fate might throw at you, go with the flow, wherever that might take you."

/obj/item/elementalessence/nathalynie
	name = "Nath Aly Nie essence"
	desc = "A little orb comprised of Nath Aly Nie, channeling Matthios' domain of thievery. It fills you with thoughts of various opportunities, of places you really were never supposed to be in, keys are a polite fiction afterall, and every lockpick you'll forge is a gateway to a world of opportunities."

